ha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gongpha/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gongpha/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gongpha/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Nice to see Opus was revived here !\n\nI see this PR was based on #47114, which was from 2021, so this PR missed the modern patterns :\n- no overrides such as `tag_used_streams`, `set_parameter`, `get_parameter`, `set_is_sample`, `get_is_sample`, `get_sample_playback`, `set_sample_playback`\n- `data` using `void*` instead of the container like `TightLocalVector`\n- Still initialize the values in the constructor instead of initializing as default values\n- properties like `length` and `loop_offset` are still using `float`. But sibling implementations like Vorbis use `double` (MP3 is using `float` too)\n\nCompared with [my own implementation from almost a year ago (outdated branch, not based on #47114)](https://github.com/gongpha/godot/tree/opus), I am skeptical about `_mix_internal`'s infinite loop handling. But I think I would leave it there if there is no significant issue or crash","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117921#pullrequestreview-4152047202","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117921","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117921#pullrequestreview-4152047202"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117921"}},"submitted_at":"2026-04-22T05:42:17Z","commit_id":"090a62eafdf4cc6f4fa920852c10a90c389d23a8"},{"id":4155729331,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc73s2Wz","user":{"login":"Joy-less","id":65855333,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1ODU1MzMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65855333?u=96896008aaba9d64a0c807a1323a218c9a31f59e&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less","ht